WEBVTT

01:26.750 --> 01:29.789
[Glory]

01:30.630 --> 01:32.910
[Episode 7]

01:33.400 --> 01:35.120
Marking the boat
won't find the lost sword.

01:35.120 --> 01:37.070
Fixed rules can't handle all changes.

01:37.070 --> 01:38.759
Sometimes, to get things done,

01:38.759 --> 01:40.000
we servants

01:40.560 --> 01:41.960
have to season the bland,

01:42.150 --> 01:43.350
or turn down the boil.

01:43.640 --> 01:44.680
We can't report every detail

01:44.680 --> 01:45.940
to the steward in time.

01:47.220 --> 01:48.320
Please forgive me, Ms. Yan.

01:48.320 --> 01:49.720
How dare you talk so much?

01:49.950 --> 01:50.870
Who gave you the guts

01:50.870 --> 01:52.930
to be so disrespectful in front of me?

01:53.170 --> 01:53.860
I did.

02:07.760 --> 02:09.030
Greetings, Miss Rong.

02:10.000 --> 02:10.630
Mrs. Yan,

02:11.150 --> 02:12.840
I asked him to attend the tea party.

02:12.840 --> 02:13.770
Don't blame him.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.030
Miss Rong,

02:15.520 --> 02:16.120
this man is just

02:16.120 --> 02:17.650
a beggar of unknown origin.

02:17.680 --> 02:18.840
Favoring him like this

02:18.840 --> 02:19.960
will stir gossip.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.730
It might bring trouble.

02:22.190 --> 02:22.750
What?

02:23.750 --> 02:25.079
If I choose to favor him,

02:25.870 --> 02:28.130
by what right do others dare question me?

02:34.560 --> 02:37.120
I spoke out of turn. Please forgive me.

02:40.079 --> 02:42.340
The swing rope in my courtyard is broken.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.350
I can fix it today.

02:51.870 --> 02:53.680
So aren't you coming?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.360
Not only is the rope broken,

03:13.360 --> 03:14.800
but the wooden seat
is also rotten with age.

03:14.800 --> 03:15.960
But it's nothing serious.

03:15.960 --> 03:16.930
In about two hours,

03:16.930 --> 03:17.680
I can make

03:17.680 --> 03:18.610
a new one for you.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.590
The old one has its charm.

03:20.590 --> 03:22.120
No need to bother making a new one.

03:22.120 --> 03:23.380
Just replace the rope.

03:40.829 --> 03:42.760
Well... Miss Rong, this is...

03:43.120 --> 03:43.840
I'd like to

03:43.840 --> 03:45.300
ask you for another favor.

03:47.120 --> 03:49.280
You come from a noble house,

03:50.150 --> 03:51.680
with everyone at your call.

03:52.590 --> 03:53.750
What else could you possibly

03:53.750 --> 03:54.840
need my help with?

03:56.680 --> 03:57.360
As you know,

03:58.200 --> 03:58.990
my cousin

03:59.520 --> 04:00.850
is a man with no schemes.

04:04.590 --> 04:06.390
You can rest assured, Miss Rong.

04:07.710 --> 04:09.640
I won't forget what I've promised.

04:10.250 --> 04:12.110
I will do my utmost to protect him.

04:13.630 --> 04:15.760
Today I made you dress up for the feast.

04:15.870 --> 04:17.470
I also showed you great favor

04:17.570 --> 04:19.690
and praised you repeatedly.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.079
You're smart.

04:23.090 --> 04:25.420
You should understand my true intention.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.360
I got it.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.190
I've been risking my life for him,

04:33.190 --> 04:34.430
but you still don't think it's enough.

04:34.430 --> 04:34.920
Now you want me

04:34.920 --> 04:36.159
to be his shield?

04:36.560 --> 04:38.420
For him, I get slandered, envied,

04:38.430 --> 04:39.560
take the hits, open and hidden,

04:39.560 --> 04:40.480
face various danger..

04:40.480 --> 04:41.159
All because he is

04:41.159 --> 04:42.159
your cousin,

04:42.180 --> 04:43.580
he gets your protection,

04:43.680 --> 04:45.000
while someone like me, with no background

04:45.000 --> 04:46.750
and low status, should just go die?

04:46.750 --> 04:48.150
Am I not born from parents

04:48.360 --> 04:50.120
who can also feel suffering and pain?

04:50.120 --> 04:51.270
Haven't I risked my life for you,

04:51.270 --> 04:53.040
Miss Rong?

04:54.860 --> 04:56.850
For the sake of your childhood cousin,

04:56.850 --> 04:57.920
you'd just stand by

04:57.920 --> 04:59.520
and watch me walk to my death?

04:59.630 --> 05:01.360
Enough with the life and death talk.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.620
You're overstepping.

05:02.830 --> 05:03.630
If it weren't for

05:03.630 --> 05:04.720
Miss Rong's kindness in saving people,

05:04.720 --> 05:06.720
you think you'd survive till today?

05:12.680 --> 05:14.450
I'll repay your kindness one day,

05:14.450 --> 05:15.560
Miss Rong,

05:17.560 --> 05:18.800
but in this way.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.830
If that's all,

05:21.830 --> 05:22.890
I'll take my leave.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.720
Stop right there!

05:25.070 --> 05:26.200
I will fix the swing,

05:26.460 --> 05:28.260
you can rest assured, Miss Rong.

05:28.600 --> 05:29.240
Damn it!

05:29.510 --> 05:30.120
Miss Rong!

05:31.430 --> 05:32.120
The Rong family has more than

05:32.120 --> 05:33.180
just him to rely on.

05:33.600 --> 05:34.360
Without him,

05:34.830 --> 05:36.159
can't I get things done?

05:46.210 --> 05:46.810
You there.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.159
This swing was personally built

05:49.159 --> 05:50.830
by Mr. Wen for Miss Rong.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.850
Please be careful with it.

05:53.680 --> 05:54.970
Old things have their charm.

05:54.970 --> 05:56.600
No need to bother making a new one.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.860
Just replace the rope.

06:25.880 --> 06:27.540
I recognized your footsteps.

06:27.750 --> 06:29.480
You're that scholar named Bai.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.270
If you were like me,

06:32.870 --> 06:34.720
relying only on your hearing for years

06:34.720 --> 06:36.450
to distinguish subtle sounds,

06:36.560 --> 06:37.680
you would know that

06:37.680 --> 06:39.480
no two footsteps sound the same.

06:44.750 --> 06:45.360
I came specifically

06:45.360 --> 06:46.820
to thank you, Lady Yunshu.

06:47.320 --> 06:49.780
Thank you for your guidance
at the tea party.

06:50.200 --> 06:51.080
Come closer.

06:55.750 --> 06:56.950
Even closer, please.

07:05.950 --> 07:07.950
What are you smelling, Lady Yunshu?

07:10.580 --> 07:11.870
There's a scent on you.

07:12.480 --> 07:14.390
It's the stench of ink
accumulated over years

07:14.390 --> 07:16.120
from copying books for others.

07:18.480 --> 07:19.000
What?

07:19.270 --> 07:21.160
Aren't you offended by what I said?

07:21.160 --> 07:23.510
I did make my living
by copying books for others,

07:23.510 --> 07:25.270
which earned me the headmaster's favor.

07:25.270 --> 07:27.310
Later I was exempted from tuition fees

07:27.310 --> 07:28.970
and recommended to come here.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.870
Being born poor isn't my fault.

07:30.870 --> 07:32.270
There's nothing to be angry about.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.680
Yunyin is very upset.

07:34.430 --> 07:36.110
She sent you invitations twice,

07:36.110 --> 07:37.840
both politely declined by you.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.680
I just heard your footsteps

07:39.680 --> 07:40.680
hesitating,

07:40.950 --> 07:42.280
not daring to approach.

07:42.630 --> 07:43.830
Is there any concern?

07:44.390 --> 07:45.390
To speak frankly,

07:46.040 --> 07:47.430
the Rong family has many people
and much gossip.

07:47.430 --> 07:49.630
I fear provoking idle talk and trouble.

07:51.550 --> 07:53.750
We sisters are all at marriageable age.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.270
You fear getting close

07:55.270 --> 07:56.830
might spark romantic rumors,

07:56.830 --> 07:58.310
private entanglements and karma,

07:58.310 --> 08:00.920
which will ruin your reputation
and prospects.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.250
You're truly pedantic.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.260
But you worry too much.

08:09.970 --> 08:10.970
In this lifetime,

08:11.390 --> 08:12.950
I would absolutely
never take a poor scholar

08:12.950 --> 08:13.870
as my husband.

08:14.830 --> 08:15.890
Absolutely never.

08:26.320 --> 08:28.650
I've expressed my thanks. I should go now.

08:29.530 --> 08:31.160
Years ago, my mom and her parents

08:31.160 --> 08:32.960
fled from the north as refugees.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.120
The whole family crowded into a small,

08:35.120 --> 08:36.850
low-roofed shack in Nanxiawa.

08:37.630 --> 08:38.390
You were able

08:38.390 --> 08:39.840
to find copying work to do,

08:39.840 --> 08:41.570
but she could only sell herself

08:42.159 --> 08:42.870
to enter the Rong Mansion

08:42.870 --> 08:44.200
as a lowly maid.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.360
So our conversations

08:46.360 --> 08:48.360
won't attract unwanted attention.

08:49.030 --> 08:50.360
Because everyone knows

08:51.320 --> 08:52.850
that I, a little blind girl,

08:53.030 --> 08:53.840
want to firmly plant my roots

08:53.840 --> 08:55.390
in these tea hills,

08:56.220 --> 08:58.200
can only seek a helpful husband

08:58.200 --> 08:59.800
from families like Yang or He

09:00.150 --> 09:01.670
to please grandmother,

09:02.940 --> 09:05.270
and gain a better position
in this family.

09:06.320 --> 09:07.080
So...

09:09.550 --> 09:10.630
So we can talk

09:10.630 --> 09:11.910
anytime,

09:12.390 --> 09:13.790
anything,

09:14.120 --> 09:15.550
and in any way.

09:16.280 --> 09:18.380
After all, you're tactful and likable.

09:18.380 --> 09:19.630
If I were Shanbao,

09:20.080 --> 09:21.940
lacking neither gold nor silver,

09:21.960 --> 09:24.030
possessing both status and position,

09:24.030 --> 09:25.440
and all I lacked was an interesting person

09:25.440 --> 09:26.500
to keep my company,

09:26.790 --> 09:28.520
I would definitely choose you.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.720
Thank you for your kind words,
Lady Yunshu.

09:32.720 --> 09:34.790
But your Rong family
seeks a matrilocal husband,

09:34.790 --> 09:35.650
not a playmate.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.870
Then you're quite mistaken.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.150
A son-in-law in the Rong family,

09:39.150 --> 09:40.600
apart from continuing the bloodline,

09:40.600 --> 09:42.060
is nothing but a playmate.

09:42.200 --> 09:42.960
It can only be

09:42.960 --> 09:45.000
mutual respect and emotionally distant.

09:45.000 --> 09:45.960
If one day

09:46.130 --> 09:47.990
Shanbao develops true feelings,

09:48.510 --> 09:49.840
then you'd be in danger.

09:54.070 --> 09:55.150
The way you put it,

09:55.730 --> 09:59.420
the Rong family truly
is a dangerous place.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.890
You really know how to joke.

10:07.910 --> 10:08.910
A joke?

10:09.940 --> 10:11.390
Yes, it's a joke.

10:12.630 --> 10:13.670
And I

10:13.670 --> 10:15.070
cannot only joke around,

10:15.480 --> 10:16.600
but also help you.

10:17.670 --> 10:18.220
Yeju.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.050
Lady Yunshu.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.200
I lost my grip.

10:35.370 --> 10:36.000
Yeju,

10:36.510 --> 10:38.000
show Mr. Bai the way.

10:38.150 --> 10:39.270
Let him get changed

10:39.770 --> 10:41.870
Going back like this is hardly proper.

10:41.870 --> 10:42.320
Yes.

11:01.000 --> 11:03.480
Everything has its order of precedence

11:03.670 --> 11:05.070
and degrees of intimacy.

11:05.630 --> 11:06.890
They grew up together,

11:06.910 --> 11:08.150
with deep feelings for each other.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.550
She wants to protect him.

11:09.910 --> 11:11.370
That's only human nature.

11:11.550 --> 11:12.600
Nothing to fault.

11:14.770 --> 11:16.420
And what are you, then?

11:16.800 --> 11:19.130
Do you really expect her
to care about you?

11:24.750 --> 11:27.200
There's no business in this world
that can't be discussed.

11:27.200 --> 11:28.200
If she wants your help

11:28.200 --> 11:29.150
with that matter,

11:29.150 --> 11:30.790
she'll surely reward you well.

11:30.790 --> 11:32.320
What are you so angry about?

11:32.790 --> 11:34.920
Who let  you lose your temper like that!

11:35.550 --> 11:36.390
Idiot!

11:42.600 --> 11:44.070
This way, Mr. Bai.

11:50.120 --> 11:50.960
Their business

11:50.960 --> 11:52.280
has nothing to do with me.

11:52.280 --> 11:53.140
I'll ignore it.

12:00.310 --> 12:02.370
Maybe I should go check it out anyway.

12:23.170 --> 12:24.430
Everyone, come and see

12:25.030 --> 12:26.510
who's hiding

12:26.510 --> 12:27.510
in here.

12:28.550 --> 12:29.280
Lady Yunyin,

12:29.720 --> 12:30.270
how could there be

12:30.270 --> 12:31.550
a lady who peeps at men changing clothes?

12:31.550 --> 12:32.630
Have you no shame?

12:33.480 --> 12:35.010
Give me back my clothes now.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.780
I've shown you my affection
multiple times,

12:38.120 --> 12:39.850
but you didn't want my respect.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.870
So why should I save your reputation?

12:41.870 --> 12:42.750
Of course I'll invite everyone

12:42.750 --> 12:43.840
to come and see

12:44.370 --> 12:46.650
how thick your skin really is.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.240
Well?

12:48.720 --> 12:50.440
No matter how high and mighty,

12:50.550 --> 12:52.240
how cunning and sly you think you are,

12:52.240 --> 12:53.900
you still ended up in my hands.

12:54.670 --> 12:55.270
Yunshu,

12:56.120 --> 12:57.320
you really have a way.

12:57.720 --> 12:59.670
With only few words,

13:00.290 --> 13:02.150
you vented the anger on my behalf.

13:02.820 --> 13:04.360
A liar with full of lies.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.890
I shouldn't have trusted you.

13:06.890 --> 13:07.700
Mr. Bai,

13:08.320 --> 13:08.790
I advise you

13:08.790 --> 13:10.320
to quickly kowtow to Yunyin

13:10.570 --> 13:11.900
and admit your mistake.

13:12.240 --> 13:14.120
Otherwise, if she really gets angry,

13:14.120 --> 13:16.150
and throws you out on the street naked,

13:16.150 --> 13:17.940
or tells everyone you stripped

13:18.120 --> 13:19.670
and harassed the Rong's maid,

13:19.670 --> 13:21.550
the consequences would be unimaginable.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.870
That's right. Kowtow.

13:22.960 --> 13:24.600
Kowtow. Do it now.

13:24.600 --> 13:26.880
Once you kowtow, all will be forgiven.
Hurry up.

13:26.880 --> 13:28.650
What are you waiting for? Hurry.

13:28.650 --> 13:30.790
Kowtow!
Why are you just standing there?

13:30.790 --> 13:32.480
Faster!
What are you waiting for? Hurry up.

13:32.480 --> 13:34.000
Kowtow now! Quickly!

13:34.200 --> 13:35.410
That's right. Kowtow!

13:35.410 --> 13:36.130
Kowtow now!

13:41.320 --> 13:42.510
The spring air is still chilly.

13:42.510 --> 13:44.640
Mr. Bai,
please take care of yourself.

13:48.510 --> 13:49.840
Who asked you to meddle?

13:55.080 --> 13:55.810
Lady Yunyin,

13:56.550 --> 13:58.630
if Miss Rong were to learn of this,

13:58.870 --> 14:00.000
it might not be wise.

14:00.150 --> 14:01.880
Don't use her to intimidate me.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.200
Tie him up too.

14:04.910 --> 14:07.510
Strip him naked
and throw him at the front gate.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.550
I want to see

14:09.270 --> 14:10.390
if Rong Shanbao

14:10.390 --> 14:11.520
will turn against me

14:11.790 --> 14:12.790
for this servant.

14:15.310 --> 14:17.430
Look outside, please.

14:38.610 --> 14:41.640
Rong Yunyin,  how impressive you are.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.560
Only you get to choose personally.

14:43.560 --> 14:44.820
Does that mean I can't?

14:45.030 --> 14:45.790
How stingy.

14:46.790 --> 14:47.960
If he were willing,

14:48.490 --> 14:49.690
I wouldn't even care.

14:50.390 --> 14:51.720
But he's unwilling now,

14:51.910 --> 14:53.870
and you're forcing yourself on him.

14:53.870 --> 14:55.270
Are you a highway robber

14:55.560 --> 14:56.960
or a vicious murderer?

14:57.910 --> 14:58.600
Since when did the Rong family

14:58.600 --> 15:00.150
teach you to treat guests like this?

15:00.150 --> 15:02.270
You're arrogant and provoking trouble.

15:02.270 --> 15:04.390
If Grandmother hears of this tomorrow,

15:04.390 --> 15:05.200
I guarantee you won't

15:05.200 --> 15:07.860
set foot in the tea plantation
this year either.

15:16.000 --> 15:16.660
As if I care!

15:17.160 --> 15:19.620
Even pork ribs
are better-looking than him.

15:20.670 --> 15:22.730
What's a man afraid of being seen for?

15:22.780 --> 15:24.440
Can't even take a little joke.

15:24.590 --> 15:25.320
I'm leaving.

15:29.220 --> 15:31.390
Shanbao, you'd better be careful.

15:31.910 --> 15:33.620
If he's so afraid of being seen,

15:33.620 --> 15:35.120
he must have hidden sores.

15:35.410 --> 15:36.670
You're slandering me!

15:40.400 --> 15:41.110
Let's go.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.120
Calm down.

15:43.460 --> 15:45.720
Getting angry is exactly what she wants.

15:46.790 --> 15:49.390
She'll claim even more
that you have a disease.

15:52.750 --> 15:55.440
Shanbao, it was Yunyin who...

15:56.630 --> 15:57.080
I...

15:57.210 --> 15:59.180
It's alright. I don't blame you.

16:00.320 --> 16:02.720
Just don't follow her
into mischief again.

16:09.870 --> 16:12.230
Mr. Bai, Yunyin was rude and offensive.

16:13.150 --> 16:15.550
Let me escort you back
to Xinfang Pavilion.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.110
Thank you, Miss Rong.

16:32.070 --> 16:33.360
And as your friend,

16:33.360 --> 16:34.760
I can not only joke around

16:35.080 --> 16:36.150
but also help you.

16:47.600 --> 16:49.000
This time,
he could turn misfortune and disaster

16:49.000 --> 16:50.000
into blessing,

16:50.270 --> 16:52.400
he should thank you as the matchmaker.

16:52.590 --> 16:53.280
Mr. Lu,

16:53.690 --> 16:55.290
you really are a good person.

17:25.069 --> 17:28.240
Yunyin has been spoiled by Grandmother
since childhood.

17:28.240 --> 17:31.030
She acts recklessly
and speaks without restraint.

17:31.030 --> 17:33.400
I appreciate your tolerance
and generosity

17:33.400 --> 17:35.590
for not taking offense
at a young girl's behavior.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.650
I thank you on Grandmother's behalf.

17:39.450 --> 17:40.780
Don't worry, Miss Rong.

17:40.920 --> 17:43.240
Today's matter will not be spread from me,

17:43.240 --> 17:43.960
nor will it

17:45.510 --> 17:47.710
tarnish the Rong family's reputation.

18:37.750 --> 18:38.880
Let me serve the tea.

18:41.920 --> 18:42.510
Mr. Bai,

18:48.010 --> 18:49.540
Lady Rong just sent a doctor

18:49.640 --> 18:50.400
to examine all the young masters

18:50.400 --> 18:51.460
for a health check.

18:53.780 --> 18:54.540
Lady Rong...

18:56.010 --> 18:57.250
I suppose Lady Yunyin

18:57.280 --> 18:59.000
went back and exaggerated everything,

18:59.000 --> 19:00.720
shifting the blame onto you.

19:01.070 --> 19:02.400
Lady Rong, misled by slander,

19:02.400 --> 19:04.200
now seeks medical examination.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.720
Given the situation,

19:05.720 --> 19:07.250
you should return quickly,

19:07.400 --> 19:08.070
lest outsiders say

19:08.070 --> 19:09.070
you fled the scene

19:09.280 --> 19:09.750
and confirm

19:09.750 --> 19:12.010
the slander
of hidden sores or ailments.

19:18.000 --> 19:18.600
Miss Rong,

19:19.010 --> 19:21.110
I concede today's game of chess.

19:21.720 --> 19:24.180
Another day,
I'll seek your guidance again.

19:24.510 --> 19:25.440
See you, Mr. Bai.

19:35.350 --> 19:38.030
How dare you fabricate orders!

19:39.310 --> 19:40.240
There was indeed a doctor today,

19:40.240 --> 19:41.230
coming to do health checks.

19:41.230 --> 19:43.230
I didn't deliberately deceive him.

19:44.070 --> 19:44.720
However,

19:44.920 --> 19:46.920
if you're looking for a substitute,

19:47.120 --> 19:49.500
I don't think Mr. Bai is suitable.

19:52.830 --> 19:54.360
I'd like to hear the reason.

19:54.750 --> 19:55.790
He is adaptable

19:56.160 --> 19:57.480
to changing circumstances.

19:57.480 --> 19:59.340
Unfortunately, he's too clever.

19:59.350 --> 20:00.720
He avoids conflict when he can,

20:00.720 --> 20:02.780
lacking courage and determination.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.110
Just like in this chess game,

20:05.110 --> 20:06.600
he clearly had chances to win,

20:06.600 --> 20:07.110
but he

20:07.110 --> 20:08.830
feared you wouldn't be pleased

20:08.830 --> 20:10.070
and was constantly hesitating,

20:10.070 --> 20:11.160
unable to make a decision.

20:11.160 --> 20:11.820
In his eyes,

20:12.220 --> 20:13.350
you're just someone

20:13.440 --> 20:15.570
who would get upset over losing a game.

20:15.710 --> 20:17.910
What kind of person does he take you for?

20:18.070 --> 20:20.160
He's a man
who hides and conceals before you.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.000
He's too afraid

20:21.000 --> 20:22.330
to show his true nature.

20:22.570 --> 20:24.630
Don't you find him boring, Miss Rong?

20:24.900 --> 20:27.360
If he's boring,
what makes you interesting?

20:27.510 --> 20:28.480
He lacks courage,

20:28.480 --> 20:29.740
but you have boldness?

20:29.820 --> 20:31.380
You clearly rejected me outright before,

20:31.380 --> 20:33.480
yet now you came and changed your mind.

20:33.480 --> 20:34.550
As a person who goes back on his word

20:34.550 --> 20:35.970
and changes sides without remorse,

20:35.970 --> 20:37.230
why should I trust you?

20:39.480 --> 20:41.000
Because I understand your thoughts

20:41.000 --> 20:42.640
more thoroughly than he does.

20:42.640 --> 20:43.200
Because I can

20:43.200 --> 20:44.480
complete any task you assign

20:44.480 --> 20:45.880
with perfect execution.

20:46.680 --> 20:47.240
Because I

20:52.200 --> 20:53.720
won this chess game today.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.480
What do you want?

21:08.040 --> 21:09.550
Being your beloved one

21:09.580 --> 21:11.030
is like pulling chestnuts from the fire.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.690
It's a dangerous task indeed.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.450
What's in it for me?

21:25.620 --> 21:27.820
I won't just guide you, lost lamb, home.

21:28.750 --> 21:29.510
I'll find out

21:29.510 --> 21:31.040
who really wanted you dead.

21:33.110 --> 21:34.910
I'll ward off disasters for you,

21:35.240 --> 21:37.040
and make sure you come to no harm.

21:37.600 --> 21:38.460
Is that enough?

21:40.590 --> 21:41.720
Yes, that's enough.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.650
Miss Rong, you're truly generous.

21:43.770 --> 21:45.840
But… when you
stroll in the garden with a man,

21:45.840 --> 21:47.970
it's always just chess, cards, or tea.

21:48.720 --> 21:50.850
Going in circles in this little patch.

21:52.110 --> 21:53.240
If you try to pass that off

21:53.240 --> 21:54.680
as a lovers' tryst…

21:54.830 --> 21:56.290
Well, nobody would buy it.

21:57.030 --> 21:58.290
So what do you suggest?

21:59.550 --> 22:01.150
What would look convincing?

22:19.330 --> 22:22.220
♪ Misty rain shrouds the long pavilion,
frost gleams ♪

22:22.470 --> 22:25.640
♪ The ornate zither plucks shards
of the old moonlight ♪

22:25.920 --> 22:28.790
♪ The starlight shimmering in your eyes ♪

22:28.810 --> 22:32.320
♪ Is an unsolved verse
from dynasties past ♪

22:31.590 --> 22:32.720
This is your idea?

22:32.740 --> 22:35.440
♪ If mountains and rivers
are fading lines of poetry ♪

22:35.550 --> 22:36.240
In my opinion,

22:35.960 --> 22:39.190
♪ I'll be the brush tip,
watching over them for a thousand years ♪

22:36.960 --> 22:38.890
I'd rather have tea and play chess.

22:39.440 --> 22:43.110
♪ When the flames of war burn out,
I'll kiss the sorrow between your brows ♪

22:43.130 --> 22:46.510
♪ Love is the morning light
that never falls ♪

22:46.530 --> 22:49.730
♪ The scent of ink soaks
through the sorrows ♪

22:49.760 --> 22:52.830
♪ Sword shadows slice through the lies
of this fleeting world ♪

22:52.190 --> 22:52.790
Miss Rong,

22:53.160 --> 22:56.300
♪ The intertwined web
of fate in your palm ♪

22:53.350 --> 22:54.750
now this is how you swing!

22:56.320 --> 22:59.590
♪ Traps my soul,
wandering through cycles of rebirth ♪

22:59.810 --> 23:02.570
♪ Carve our vow into the cliffside,
beneath the fading sun ♪

23:03.040 --> 23:06.310
♪ Let wind and sand wear the bones,
yet never forget ♪

23:06.330 --> 23:10.150
♪ When history crumbles
into drifting dust ♪

23:10.170 --> 23:13.440
♪ You remain an undying faith ♪

23:13.470 --> 23:16.200
♪ Bronze bells stir the fragrance
of bodhi leaves ♪

23:16.830 --> 23:19.730
♪ Time hangs from the eaves
of an ancient temple ♪

23:20.080 --> 23:23.440
♪ Crushing thousands of scenes
of romance ♪

23:23.460 --> 23:26.530
♪ All just to seek an answer from you ♪

23:26.690 --> 23:29.830
♪ If this mortal world
becomes but a fleeting dream ♪

23:30.050 --> 23:33.480
♪ Love is the cold gleam
that pierces the illusion ♪

23:31.830 --> 23:32.490
Get to work.

23:33.520 --> 23:37.230
♪ At the end of all things,
we'll write our story ♪

23:37.320 --> 23:41.220
♪ With eternal heartbeats
as the final verse ♪

23:47.320 --> 23:50.470
♪ If mountains and rivers
are fading lines of poetry ♪

23:50.690 --> 23:53.740
♪ Fading lines of poetry ♪

23:51.790 --> 23:52.510
My plan

23:53.240 --> 23:54.240
is absolutely perfect.

23:54.010 --> 23:57.000
♪ I'll be the brush tip,
watching over them for a thousand years ♪

23:57.020 --> 24:00.760
♪ Love is the morning light
that never falls ♪

24:00.070 --> 24:00.790
Higher, please.

24:00.790 --> 24:03.440
♪ Carve our vow into the cliffside,
beneath the fading sun ♪

24:03.550 --> 24:06.900
♪ Let wind and sand
wear the bones, yet never forget ♪

24:07.300 --> 24:10.990
♪ When history
crumbles into drifting dust ♪

24:11.010 --> 24:14.040
♪ You remain an undying faith ♪

24:14.180 --> 24:17.070
♪ Bronze bells stir the fragrance
of bodhi leaves ♪

24:17.670 --> 24:20.260
♪ Time hangs from the eaves
of an ancient temple ♪

24:17.830 --> 24:18.400
Shanbao!

24:20.670 --> 24:24.020
♪ Crushing thousands of scenes
of romance ♪

24:24.380 --> 24:27.230
♪ All just to seek an answer from you ♪

24:27.810 --> 24:33.830
♪ With eternal heartbeats
as the final verse ♪

24:32.830 --> 24:33.830
Are you all right?

24:34.800 --> 24:35.590
I was,

24:36.200 --> 24:37.270
until you scared the soul

24:37.270 --> 24:38.130
right out of me!

24:40.200 --> 24:42.590
Miss Rong,
since you need to talk with Mr. Wen,

24:42.590 --> 24:43.850
I'll take my leave now.

25:01.030 --> 25:03.160
Shanbao, you're usually

25:03.310 --> 25:05.310
not one for such playful activities.

25:05.310 --> 25:08.000
What possessed you
to swing so recklessly today?

25:08.000 --> 25:09.130
Just a passing whim.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.280
What made you here today?

25:14.200 --> 25:16.130
[Rong Mansion]

25:17.880 --> 25:18.550
Lu Fusheng!

25:21.480 --> 25:23.010
What makes you so cheerful?

25:24.270 --> 25:25.000
Everyone in the household

25:25.000 --> 25:27.420
is busy preparing
for the Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony.

25:27.420 --> 25:28.950
I instructed you yesterday

25:29.030 --> 25:30.350
to gather everyone listed

25:30.350 --> 25:31.880
on the roster early this morning

25:31.880 --> 25:33.110
to receive my assignments.

25:33.110 --> 25:34.030
Did my words just vanish into thin air?

25:34.030 --> 25:34.890
Steward Cheng,

25:35.350 --> 25:36.880
with hundreds of souls
in the Rong Mansion,

25:36.880 --> 25:38.310
isn't that enough for you to command?

25:38.310 --> 25:39.000
On my first day here,

25:39.000 --> 25:39.980
I made myself perfectly clear.

25:39.980 --> 25:40.920
I stayed only out of gratitude

25:40.920 --> 25:42.030
for Miss Rong saving my life,

25:42.030 --> 25:42.790
nothing more.

25:42.790 --> 25:43.350
You can give those ceremonial duties, .

25:43.350 --> 25:44.550
the offerings, the tea service

25:44.550 --> 25:45.610
to anyone you like.

25:45.810 --> 25:47.570
I only answer to Qilan Garden.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.110
I can't be bothered
with such trivial matters.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.110
Outrageous!

25:50.830 --> 25:51.830
If Miss Rong knew about

25:51.830 --> 25:53.160
your insolent remarks,

25:54.630 --> 25:56.500
she'd be the first to punish you.

25:57.360 --> 25:58.820
Go ahead and tell her then.

25:59.240 --> 26:00.160
I'm busy

26:00.160 --> 26:01.680
making a kite for Bao.

26:02.340 --> 26:03.740
No time for your chatter.

26:05.510 --> 26:07.030
How dare you call Miss Rong 's nick name!

26:07.030 --> 26:09.400
'Willow twigs for thread,
catkin for cotton spun,

26:09.400 --> 26:11.790
A thousand lengths
to fly the paper kite begun.

26:11.790 --> 26:13.690
How much of
the spring breeze's strength is spent,

26:13.690 --> 26:16.690
To carry the young ones
to the heavens, heaven-sent?'

26:22.290 --> 26:24.770
Mr. Yang, what are you doing here?

26:25.300 --> 26:26.400
The person who fought me

26:26.400 --> 26:29.240
at the martial arts arena that day
was you, wasn't it?

26:29.240 --> 26:30.840
Mr. Yang, you must be joking.

26:31.070 --> 26:31.720
A mere servant like me

26:31.720 --> 26:33.250
wouldn't be worthy
of the martial arts arena.

26:33.250 --> 26:34.830
It was Mr. Wen who bested you.

26:34.830 --> 26:35.890
Don't block my way.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.240
What exactly do you want?

26:43.240 --> 26:45.030
To have a rematch, of course.

26:48.000 --> 26:48.860
Steward Cheng!

26:49.790 --> 26:50.650
Steward Cheng!

26:50.700 --> 26:51.830
Just listen to this!

26:51.850 --> 26:53.450
What nonsense is he talking?

26:53.790 --> 26:55.160
A real man stands firm
between heaven and earth.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.280
His word is his bond.

26:56.280 --> 26:56.920
How can someone lose

26:56.920 --> 26:58.380
and then demand a rematch?

26:58.680 --> 27:00.350
The sheer gall!

27:02.240 --> 27:04.070
Come on, explain this to me.

27:04.880 --> 27:05.680
Be my witness!

27:06.700 --> 27:07.960
A real man would never do anything

27:07.960 --> 27:08.680
sneaky

27:09.030 --> 27:10.240
or underhanded.

27:11.350 --> 27:12.030
If you win,

27:12.360 --> 27:13.930
win with honor,

27:14.610 --> 27:16.760
so others truly accept defeat.

27:26.440 --> 27:27.920
No, you can't agree.

27:28.750 --> 27:30.270
You can't accept this.

27:33.790 --> 27:35.590
Do not engage in private fights!

27:40.240 --> 27:41.900
If you're too scared to fight,

27:42.450 --> 27:44.650
then pack and get out of the Rong family.

27:52.400 --> 27:54.130
Fine, let's have this contest.

27:54.950 --> 27:56.150
I'm not afraid of you.

27:58.920 --> 27:59.480
Good.

28:00.380 --> 28:01.680
Tomorrow at noon,

28:02.270 --> 28:04.440
I'll wait for you in the bamboo grove
behind the hill.

28:04.440 --> 28:05.960
Mr. Bai, please

28:06.550 --> 28:08.000
be our witness.

28:20.640 --> 28:22.170
Everyone in the Rong family

28:23.480 --> 28:25.340
knows your affair with Miss Rong.

28:26.400 --> 28:26.960
Also,

28:27.510 --> 28:28.670
knowing how jealous he is,

28:28.670 --> 28:30.270
you should have avoided him.

28:30.270 --> 28:31.240
How can you knowingly

28:31.240 --> 28:32.130
walk into a dead end

28:32.130 --> 28:33.730
and fight this battle alone?

28:33.850 --> 28:36.110
Mr. Bai, thank you for saying these to me.

28:36.790 --> 28:38.590
It makes saving you worthwhile.

28:43.090 --> 28:43.490
You...

28:44.070 --> 28:46.030
you're really going to die.

28:46.860 --> 28:47.900
You'll die!

28:57.030 --> 28:58.430
You all drink and gamble,

28:58.700 --> 29:00.830
only to send me here to sharpen swords?

29:01.030 --> 29:02.750
Black-hearted bullies picking on the weak!

29:02.750 --> 29:04.550
Eating meat only to get the runs!

29:11.540 --> 29:12.400
Well, well,

29:13.880 --> 29:15.400
I've caught you now.

29:15.640 --> 29:16.940
Oh, it's Brother Chang.

29:16.940 --> 29:18.470
You scared me half to death.

29:25.310 --> 29:26.970
We're from the same hometown.

29:27.020 --> 29:28.620
How could I shortchange you?

29:29.510 --> 29:30.970
You really look out for me.

29:31.070 --> 29:31.640
Go dig in.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.350
I'll do your work for you.

29:33.350 --> 29:34.880
I won't let you get scolded.

29:35.270 --> 29:35.680
Okay.

30:09.790 --> 30:10.590
Young Master.

30:26.880 --> 30:27.510
Not bad.

30:28.220 --> 30:29.440
Truly worthy of being
a trusted aide

30:29.440 --> 30:30.170
to Miss Rong.

30:30.200 --> 30:31.630
You're quite clever and careful.

30:31.630 --> 30:32.850
Miss Rong repeatedly instructed me

30:32.850 --> 30:34.180
to take good care of you.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.960
If anything happens to you,

30:35.960 --> 30:37.640
I couldn't bear the punishment.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.970
Did she really say that?

30:41.230 --> 30:43.160
I guess she's not that heartless.

30:43.710 --> 30:44.600
Mr. Lu,

30:44.830 --> 30:45.790
things are extremely urgent now,

30:45.790 --> 30:47.680
how can you still sit here so calmly?

30:47.680 --> 30:49.450
I'll go inform Miss Rong right away.

30:49.450 --> 30:49.980
No hurry.

30:50.680 --> 30:51.550
When you see Miss Rong,

30:51.550 --> 30:52.680
what do you plan to tell her?

30:52.680 --> 30:53.880
The truth, of course.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.000
When you see her,

30:55.000 --> 30:55.920
don't mention a single word

30:55.920 --> 30:57.450
about what happened today.

30:57.590 --> 30:58.720
You may only tell her

30:59.200 --> 31:00.510
that I've accepted the challenge.

31:00.510 --> 31:02.240
Tomorrow I will fight that Yang fellow

31:02.240 --> 31:03.550
to the death.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.520
No matter how much I pleaded,

31:13.790 --> 31:15.120
Mr. Lu wouldn't listen.

31:15.550 --> 31:16.640
Once the weather changes,

31:16.640 --> 31:17.350
all his old wounds

31:17.350 --> 31:18.480
hurt him to the bone.

31:19.000 --> 31:20.460
He's no match for Mr. Yang.

31:24.440 --> 31:25.770
I'm going out for a walk.

31:54.350 --> 31:55.510
He is quite odd.

31:56.070 --> 31:57.960
Tomorrow's contest
is a matter of life and death.

31:57.960 --> 31:59.420
He came here at this moment

31:59.550 --> 32:01.310
surely for something important.

32:01.310 --> 32:03.440
Why stop at the door without coming in?

32:08.920 --> 32:10.160
No, you can't.

32:09.200 --> 32:10.020
[Xinfang Pavilion]

32:10.360 --> 32:10.880
Mr. Lu.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.280
You can't fight with him.

32:13.920 --> 32:15.510
Yang Dingchen has incredible strength

32:15.510 --> 32:16.720
and ruthless techniques.

32:16.720 --> 32:17.920
Last time you got lucky,

32:17.920 --> 32:18.980
but in a real fight,

32:19.350 --> 32:20.790
your life would be at risk.

32:20.790 --> 32:21.790
Just listen to me.

32:22.350 --> 32:23.410
Swallow your pride

32:23.750 --> 32:25.030
to preserve your life.

32:25.960 --> 32:26.830
Did you hear me?

32:29.960 --> 32:30.760
It's my fault.

32:31.470 --> 32:32.750
You're still recovering
from your injuries.

32:32.750 --> 32:34.680
Why trouble yourself to come here?

32:35.480 --> 32:36.540
Please take a seat.

32:44.920 --> 32:45.520
Yuan Xiao.

32:46.240 --> 32:47.170
Coming, Mr. Wen.

32:53.350 --> 32:53.810
This...

32:54.680 --> 32:55.350
This is...

32:55.790 --> 32:57.350
Weapons in the martial arts arena
no mercy.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.950
I'm truly worried about you.

32:59.480 --> 33:00.750
This is a soft armor vest

33:00.750 --> 33:01.790
my cousin gave me.

33:03.070 --> 33:04.800
At least it can shield you a bit.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.160
I can't accept this.

33:20.480 --> 33:21.740
This is a precious gift

33:21.830 --> 33:23.310
that Miss Rong bestowed upon you.

33:23.310 --> 33:24.970
It's one of a kind in the world.

33:25.310 --> 33:27.070
How could I ask you to part with it?

33:27.070 --> 33:28.270
Using it for its purpose

33:28.270 --> 33:30.070
honors my cousin's intentions.

33:30.310 --> 33:31.510
Please don't refuse.

33:31.550 --> 33:32.410
Just accept it.

33:34.070 --> 33:35.640
Your kindness is appreciated.

33:35.640 --> 33:37.570
Refusing would be disrespectful.

33:37.960 --> 33:40.440
Jundai, please accept it for me.

33:46.070 --> 33:47.000
I'll go try it on.

34:30.670 --> 34:32.400
Life or death, no holds barred.

34:32.670 --> 34:34.400
Life or death, no holds barred.

34:54.489 --> 34:56.159
[Rongxi Hall]

34:57.030 --> 34:57.630
Just look

34:58.150 --> 34:59.880
what kind of mess have you made?

35:00.400 --> 35:01.150
Yunyin.

35:01.590 --> 35:02.880
He's just a scholar.

35:03.360 --> 35:04.620
If you truly liked him,

35:04.760 --> 35:06.280
you should have told Grandmother early on.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.800
She wouldn't have refused you.

35:07.800 --> 35:09.860
Was it worth resorting
to such despicable means,

35:09.860 --> 35:11.420
not only shaming yourself

35:11.480 --> 35:13.230
but also spreading ugly rumors.

35:13.230 --> 35:14.840
You're the Fourth Young Lady
of the Rong family,

35:14.840 --> 35:16.770
not some female bandit from Longjing Hill.

35:16.770 --> 35:19.430
Why do you act more recklessly
as you grow older?

35:23.590 --> 35:25.290
I've always been straightforward,

35:25.290 --> 35:26.820
saying exactly what I mean.

35:27.280 --> 35:28.400
Grandmother, you're making such a fuss

35:28.400 --> 35:29.760
arranging marriage for Shanbao.

35:29.760 --> 35:30.440
But is she the only daughter

35:30.440 --> 35:31.500
of the Rong family?

35:32.110 --> 35:33.630
What about Yunxi, Yun'e

35:34.480 --> 35:35.230
and Yunshu?

35:35.780 --> 35:37.840
They're all your flesh and blood too.

35:38.230 --> 35:38.880
Their marriages

35:38.880 --> 35:40.410
haven't been arranged yet.

35:40.510 --> 35:42.400
There is an order to age and seniority.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.510
Shanbao's matter

35:43.510 --> 35:44.770
must be settled first.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.110
I've said before,

35:58.920 --> 36:00.000
as long as you like,

36:00.630 --> 36:01.400
not just one,

36:02.000 --> 36:03.400
even if I yield all to you,

36:03.430 --> 36:04.490
I wouldn't object.

36:05.280 --> 36:06.740
We are sisters, after all.

36:07.000 --> 36:09.280
We should be united,
supporting each other.

36:09.280 --> 36:10.440
How can we let outsiders

36:10.440 --> 36:11.570
damage our harmony?

36:13.280 --> 36:15.230
Now you pretend to be the generous one?

36:15.230 --> 36:16.560
Who needs your charity?

36:16.920 --> 36:18.280
For the fruit you don't want,

36:18.280 --> 36:19.460
isn't it crushed and trampled
before

36:19.460 --> 36:20.710
you'd ever pass it to others?

36:20.710 --> 36:21.320
Silence!

36:22.190 --> 36:22.800
Yunyin.

36:24.630 --> 36:26.320
How dare you
speak to your sister like that?

36:26.320 --> 36:27.780
Have you no manners at all?

36:31.150 --> 36:32.710
Yunyin, stop talking.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.800
You're soft-hearted,

36:35.190 --> 36:37.120
but your sharp tongue ruins it all.

36:37.550 --> 36:39.950
Who can't see through your little schemes?

36:40.510 --> 36:41.000
Seeing Grandmother

36:41.000 --> 36:43.000
being busy with Shanbao's matters,

36:43.030 --> 36:44.760
your jealousy is overflowing.

36:45.220 --> 36:46.680
You should think about it.

36:46.960 --> 36:47.760
Haven't you considered
that in the past,

36:47.760 --> 36:49.350
when Chongxi Hall
received anything good,

36:49.350 --> 36:51.150
it was always given to you first?

36:52.110 --> 36:54.710
Clearly,
Grandmother favors you in her heart.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.420
Now quickly apologize to her.

36:58.590 --> 36:59.190
Hurry up!

36:59.800 --> 37:01.400
If the eggs weren't cracked,

37:01.840 --> 37:03.370
even a fly with a sharp mouth

37:03.710 --> 37:04.640
couldn't get in.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.440
Fine.

37:05.960 --> 37:07.280
I won't provoke this Zhang

37:07.280 --> 37:08.010
or that Wang,

37:08.550 --> 37:10.010
but he barged in on his own,

37:10.020 --> 37:11.440
brazenly changing clothes,

37:11.440 --> 37:12.840
being shameless and brazen,

37:12.840 --> 37:14.190
It shows his improper intentions

37:14.190 --> 37:15.250
and bad character.

37:15.670 --> 37:16.070
Since he's such a

37:16.070 --> 37:18.110
worthless,
disgraceful scoundrel,

37:18.110 --> 37:19.970
Shanbao still wants to pass him to me!

37:19.970 --> 37:21.630
Isn't that clearly an insult?

37:26.390 --> 37:28.720
Blame me for not talking her out of it.

37:29.510 --> 37:31.280
Yunyin just wanted to test him.

37:32.000 --> 37:34.460
She meant well
but ended up causing trouble.

37:35.230 --> 37:36.480
Listen to what you've said.

37:36.480 --> 37:38.020
You'd argue that the dead are alive!

37:38.020 --> 37:40.110
So you're saying that
by testing him for Shanbao,

37:40.110 --> 37:42.030
you are not at fault
but actually deserve credit?

37:42.030 --> 37:43.670
Grandmother should reward you instead?

37:43.670 --> 37:44.000
You!

37:47.540 --> 37:49.140
You're all in this together.

37:49.590 --> 37:51.440
How can you twist
right and wrong like this?

37:51.440 --> 37:53.500
You'd slander a good person to death.

38:17.510 --> 38:18.110
You lost.

38:19.590 --> 38:22.150
My skills are inferior — I lost, so be it.

38:52.360 --> 38:52.880
Mr. Lu.

38:53.780 --> 38:54.230
Mr. Lu.

38:54.900 --> 38:56.300
Mr. Lu, are you all right?

38:56.550 --> 38:57.070
Mr. Lu.

38:57.980 --> 38:59.180
Mr. Lu. what's wrong?

38:59.510 --> 39:00.000
Mr. Lu.

39:01.000 --> 39:01.440
Mr. Lu.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.130
Mr. Lu, are you okay?

39:03.590 --> 39:04.000
Mr. Lu.

39:05.150 --> 39:05.590
Mr. Lu.

39:06.010 --> 39:07.210
Mr. Lu, what's wrong?

39:07.750 --> 39:09.550
Mr. Lu, don't scare me like this!

39:15.800 --> 39:16.920
Grandmother.

39:18.150 --> 39:19.320
Grandmother.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.630
I meant well.

39:23.030 --> 39:24.590
Please don't blame me.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.280
People say idle hands make mischief.

39:27.280 --> 39:28.150
If you would allow me

39:28.150 --> 39:29.670
to gain experience at the tea plantation,

39:29.670 --> 39:30.230
perhaps there wouldn't be

39:30.230 --> 39:31.230
so many problems.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.760
Don't worry, Grandmother.

39:33.760 --> 39:35.290
Mr. Bai knows what matters.

39:35.590 --> 39:37.050
He won't spread it around.

39:37.230 --> 39:38.320
However, Xinfang Pavilion

39:38.320 --> 39:39.850
still houses the He family.

39:39.860 --> 39:41.550
We must be more careful in the future.

39:41.550 --> 39:42.280
Just listen.

39:43.250 --> 39:45.000
Bao came early to plead for you,

39:45.440 --> 39:46.900
asking me not to blame you.

39:47.670 --> 39:49.320
As for those in Xinfang Pavilion,

39:49.320 --> 39:50.920
if there's anyone you fancy,

39:50.960 --> 39:53.000
she would never compete with her sisters.

39:53.000 --> 39:54.800
Personal feelings
don't cloud her judgment.

39:54.800 --> 39:56.360
She puts the Rong family
above everything else.

39:56.360 --> 39:58.880
That's the demeanor
of a true head of household.

39:58.880 --> 40:00.340
You should learn from her.

40:16.140 --> 40:18.150
The order of seniority and respect
must not be disturbed.

40:18.150 --> 40:20.030
On the day of
the Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony,

40:20.030 --> 40:22.190
Bao will surely choose a worthy husband.

40:22.190 --> 40:24.360
Afterward, you may choose as you wish.

40:24.840 --> 40:28.230
If any of you dare cause another scandal
and become a laughingstock,

40:28.230 --> 40:30.160
I will be the first to not spare you!

40:36.040 --> 40:37.070
Copy 'The Classic of Tea' 100 times

40:37.070 --> 40:38.400
before you see me again.

40:40.510 --> 40:41.310
Grandmother.

40:41.880 --> 40:42.840
Grandmother.

40:50.150 --> 40:50.760
Putting on an act

40:50.760 --> 40:52.550
of being a kind and generous elder sister.

40:52.550 --> 40:53.480
So you already came to Grandmother

40:53.480 --> 40:54.830
to poison her against me.

40:54.830 --> 40:56.290
Now you must be satisfied.

40:56.510 --> 40:57.360
You're incompetent yourself,

40:57.360 --> 40:58.690
yet full of complaints.

40:58.960 --> 41:00.320
You brought this shame upon yourself.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.720
How can you blame others?

41:03.640 --> 41:05.370
I'd rather marry a poor scholar

41:06.510 --> 41:09.190
than someone who fancies a lowly servant!

41:09.920 --> 41:11.980
If we ever share a table in the future,

41:12.260 --> 41:14.090
should he call us masters,

41:14.510 --> 41:16.440
or should we call him brother-in-law?

41:16.440 --> 41:17.150
Shanbao,

41:17.740 --> 41:19.470
you really aren't picky at all.

41:20.670 --> 41:22.070
Master or servant,

41:22.600 --> 41:23.810
it's all up to me.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.440
Yunyin, if you have time

41:25.440 --> 41:26.480
for idle gossip,

41:27.360 --> 41:29.400
you'd better go back to your copying.

41:29.400 --> 41:32.200
You'll probably be working
until midnight today.

41:32.490 --> 41:33.180
You...

41:36.480 --> 41:37.110
Miss Rong.

41:37.840 --> 41:40.240
Miss Rong, something's happened to Mr. Lu.

41:43.260 --> 41:45.990
Enough.
Aren't you embarrassed enough already?

41:46.710 --> 41:47.440
Let her go.

41:47.920 --> 41:49.880
Yunyin, I'll grind the ink for you.

41:50.500 --> 41:51.060
Get lost!

42:16.240 --> 42:16.840
Miss Rong.

42:21.790 --> 42:22.320
Shanbao.

42:28.440 --> 42:30.360
Miss Rong, why are you here?

42:31.070 --> 42:33.000
This is not the place you should be.

42:33.300 --> 42:35.100
Mr. Bai, why didn't you stop her?

42:35.760 --> 42:36.360
Miss Rong.

42:36.550 --> 42:38.230
Fortunately,
he was wearing body armor today,

42:38.230 --> 42:39.430
so the vital organs weren't injured.

42:39.430 --> 42:41.400
However,
the wound looks quite frightening,

42:41.400 --> 42:42.920
better not look at it.

42:55.590 --> 42:56.460
What are you standing there for?

42:56.460 --> 42:58.590
Hurry and change the medicinal cloth.

43:10.370 --> 43:11.700
The sword was poisoned?

43:11.920 --> 43:12.440
Yes.

43:13.510 --> 43:14.760
The sword was laced with arsenic

43:14.760 --> 43:15.620
and monkshood.

43:15.930 --> 43:17.730
If I had arrived even a bit later,

43:18.320 --> 43:19.280
the one lying on the bed

43:19.280 --> 43:20.610
would be a corpse by now.

43:21.230 --> 43:24.030
This assailant's intentions
were truly vicious.

43:24.110 --> 43:25.710
Shanbao, don't be upset yet.

43:25.760 --> 43:27.230
Yang Dingchen is too proud of his status,

43:27.230 --> 43:28.590
so he'll certainly deny everything.

43:28.590 --> 43:30.320
We must handle this carefully.

43:32.710 --> 43:34.030
Where is Cheng Guanyu?

43:34.880 --> 43:36.140
Tell him to personally

43:36.360 --> 43:37.510
invite Mr. Yang here.
